            "textentryhtml":"<p>\n\tNovember 9, 1989, Paul Arany, New York, sold to the Princeton University Art Museum [1].\n</p>\n<p>\n\tNotes:\n\t<br />\n\t[1] According to an Arany invoice in the curatorial file.\n\t<br />\n</p>",
